        "runId": "ada-en-amanda-mw6juwms-in2zy2i",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Days 9–10 are spent crossing the Drake Passage on the return journey. You can watch for the same seabirds you saw on the way south. Sea conditions determine when we leave Antarctica and how the crossing progresses."
